sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant API as ChildrenService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant L as EqLevels / recommend
  P->>API: GET /children/:id/eq-report
  API->>DB: own child?
  API->>DB: checkpoint_answers of first plays, score not null, checkpoint not excluded
  API->>DB: pedagogy report settings (window 5, min 3, thresholds 0.5 / 0.8)
  API->>L: buildEqLevels per sub-skill -> competency (lowest level)
  API->>L: recommendTopics for weakest competencies
  API-->>P: radar 5 competencies + sub-skills + suggested topics
